    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "When using `CGImageSource` functions to read from a HEIF, JPEG, or DNG file containing depth data (as well as image data), you can use the [`CGImageSourceCopyAuxiliaryDataInfoAtIndex(_:_:_:)`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ImageIO/CGImageSourceCopyAuxiliaryDataInfoAtIndex(_:_:_:)) function to load primitive depth map information, then use this initializer to create an [`AVDepthData`](avdepthdata.md) object, as shown below.",
      "normalizedSource": "When using `CGImageSource` functions to read from a HEIF, JPEG, or DNG file containing depth data (as well as image data), you can use the [`CGImageSourceCopyAuxiliaryDataInfoAtIndex(_:_:_:)`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ImageIO/CGImageSourceCopyAuxiliaryDataInfoAtIndex(_:_:_:)) function to load primitive depth map information, then use this initializer to create an [`AVDepthData`](avdepthdata.md) object, as shown below.",
      "sourceHash": "6b2370f9abb0cb0d80bc3884a0b03050a0bd044562788ffbb632b3c57aa100f2",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\n- (nullable AVDepthData *)depthDataFromImageData:(nonnull NSData *)imageData {\n\tAVDepthData *depthData = nil;\n\n    CGImageSourceRef imageSource = CGImageSourceCreateWithData((CFDataRef)imageData, NULL);\n\tif (imageSource) {\n\t\tNSDictionary *auxDataDictionary = (__bridge NSDictionary *)CGImageSourceCopyAuxiliaryDataInfoAtIndex(imageSource, 0, kCGImageAuxiliaryDataTypeDisparity);\n\t\tif (auxDataDictionary) {\n\t\t\tdepthData = [AVDepthData depthDataFromDictionaryRepresentation:auxDataDictionary error:NULL];\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tCFRelease(imageSource);\n\t}\n\n    return depthData;\n}\n```",
      "documentTitle": "init(fromDictionaryRepresentation:)",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "ko": "`CGImageSource` 함수를 사용해 깊이 데이터(및 이미지 데이터)가 포함된 HEIF, JPEG 또는 DNG 파일에서 읽을 때, [`CGImageSourceCopyAuxiliaryDataInfoAtIndex(_:_:_:)`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ImageIO/CGImageSourceCopyAuxiliaryDataInfoAtIndex(_:_:_:)) 함수를 통해 원시 깊이 맵 정보를 로드한 뒤, 아래와 같이 이 초기화 메서드를 사용해 [`AVDepthData`](avdepthdata.md) 객체를 생성할 수 있습니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
      "translatedAt": "2026-05-12T15:21:32.150Z",
      "translator": "codex-cli-oauth"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0011:0001",
      "blockId": "code:discussion:0011",
      "type": "preserve",
      "source": "```swift\n- (nullable AVDepthData *)depthDataFromImageData:(nonnull NSData *)imageData {\n\tAVDepthData *depthData = nil;\n\n    CGImageSourceRef imageSource = CGImageSourceCreateWithData((CFDataRef)imageData, NULL);\n\tif (imageSource) {\n\t\tNSDictionary *auxDataDictionary = (__bridge NSDictionary *)CGImageSourceCopyAuxiliaryDataInfoAtIndex(imageSource, 0, kCGImageAuxiliaryDataTypeDisparity);\n\t\tif (auxDataDictionary) {\n\t\t\tdepthData = [AVDepthData depthDataFromDictionaryRepresentation:auxDataDictionary error:NULL];\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tCFRelease(imageSource);\n\t}\n\n    return depthData;\n}\n```",
      "normalizedSource": "```swift - (nullable AVDepthData *)depthDataFromImageData:(nonnull NSData *)imageData { AVDepthData *depthData = nil; CGImageSourceRef imageSource = CGImageSourceCreateWithData((CFDataRef)imageData, NULL); if (imageSource) { NSDictionary *auxDataDictionary = (__bridge NSDictionary *)CGImageSourceCopyAuxiliaryDataInfoAtIndex(imageSource, 0, kCGImageAuxiliaryDataTypeDisparity); if (auxDataDictionary) { depthData = [AVDepthData depthDataFromDictionaryRepresentation:auxDataDictionary error:NULL]; } CFRelease(imageSource); } return depthData; } ```",
      "sourceHash": "8688bdb5b8ba3faeee179ff288f8e58e38be7edf09cb52d319acd21ba1af81e8",
      "translatable": false,
      "preserveReason": "code",
      "contextBefore": "When using `CGImageSource` functions to read from a HEIF, JPEG, or DNG file containing depth data (as well as image data), you can use the [`CGImageSourceCopyAuxiliaryDataInfoAtIndex(_:_:_:)`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ImageIO/CGImageSourceCopyAuxiliaryDataInfoAtIndex(_:_:_:)) function to load primitive depth map information, then use this initializer to create an [`AVDepthData`](avdepthdata.md) object, as shown below.",
      "contextAfter": "Parameters",
      "documentTitle": "init(fromDictionaryRepresentation:)",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "ko": "```swift\n- (nullable AVDepthData *)depthDataFromImageData:(nonnull NSData *)imageData {\n\tAVDepthData *depthData = nil;\n\n    CGImageSourceRef imageSource = CGImageSourceCreateWithData((CFDataRef)imageData, NULL);\n\tif (imageSource) {\n\t\tNSDictionary *auxDataDictionary = (__bridge NSDictionary *)CGImageSourceCopyAuxiliaryDataInfoAtIndex(imageSource, 0, kCGImageAuxiliaryDataTypeDisparity);\n\t\tif (auxDataDictionary) {\n\t\t\tdepthData = [AVDepthData depthDataFromDictionaryRepresentation:auxDataDictionary error:NULL];\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tCFRelease(imageSource);\n\t}\n\n    return depthData;\n}\n```",
      "status": "preserved",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": true
    },
